# From near the arena centre the walls are ~8000 away: they should show in every direction.
wait 17
press down
# cpu is a one-second average: let it settle before each shot
wait 2.5
shot round_1_north
press right
wait 2.5
shot round_2_east
press right
wait 2.5
shot round_3_south
press right
wait 2.5
shot round_4_west
